Package: adlaplaceGrf
Type: Package
Title: FEM Matérn Gaussian Random Fields for adlaplace
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Patrick", family = "Brown",
    email = "patrick.brown@utoronto.ca",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tensor-product B-spline finite-element ingredients for Matérn
    Gaussian random fields (mass, stiffness, and higher-order Grams) for use
    with the adlaplace Laplace approximation framework. Provides design and
    Gram matrix construction on regular grids, with optional terra SpatRaster /
    SpatVector input.
