Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0),
    adlaplace (>= 0.4.0)
Imports: methods, stats, Matrix, splines
Suggests: terra, testthat (>= 3.0.0), quarto
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: quarto
